<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Jibhi-Shoja couple trip map list</name><Folder><name>stays</name><Placemark><name>Moonlight View Cottage</name><address>Moonlight View Cottage, Jibhi, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Jibhi hill | Cottage | under2500 | Price: 2480 | Rating: 4.97 (88, Airbnb) | Proven hill quiet above market; cedar-wood, valley deck, 10â€“15 min walk to cafes. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Moonlight%20View%20Cottage%2C%20Jibhi%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52829977</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Bastiat Whispering Pines Cabin</name><address>Bastiat Stays Whispering Pines, Tandi, Jibhi</address><description>Tandi | Cabin | stretch | Price: 2710 | Rating: 4.92 (236, Airbnb) | 236-review forest legacy; 360Â° Himalaya deck; no music after 8 pm. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Bastiat%20Stays%20Whispering%20Pines%2C%20Tandi%2C%20Jibhi | Book: https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/26117817</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Latoda Tree House</name><address>Latoda Tree House, Ghiyagi, Jibhi</address><description>Ghiyagi forest | Treehouse | stretch | Price: 2600 | Rating: 4.89 (200, Airbnb) | Forest treehouse; peak couple-novelty pick. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Latoda%20Tree%20House%2C%20Ghiyagi%2C%20Jibhi | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/shoja-india/stays</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Wayward Inn Entire Place</name><address>Wayward Inn, Ghiyagi, Jibhi</address><description>Ghiyagi | Entire place | under2500 | Price: 2240 | Rating: 4.78 (136, Airbnb) | Whole place to yourselves in quiet Ghiyagi. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Wayward%20Inn%2C%20Ghiyagi%2C%20Jibhi | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/jibhi-india/stays</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Tandi Mountain Cottage</name><address>Tandi village, Jibhi, Banjar, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Tandi | Cottage | under2500 | Price: 2120 | Rating: 4.82 (34, Airbnb) | Village quiet above Jibhi; mountain aspect. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Tandi%20village%2C%20Jibhi%2C%20Banjar%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/jibhi-india/stays</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Mudhouse Peaks N Valley</name><address>Mudhouse Peaks N Valley, Chhet, Jibhi</address><description>Chhet | Mudhouse | stretch | Price: 2830 | Rating: 5.0 (14, Airbnb) | Secluded cliff cottage; splurge only. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mudhouse%20Peaks%20N%20Valley%2C%20Chhet%2C%20Jibhi | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1412122997309117906</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Lost Escape Riverside</name><address>The Lost Escape, Jibhi, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Jibhi riverside | Riverside | under2500 | Price: 2000 | Rating: 5.0 (19, Airbnb) | River isolation; sit-out over water; strong couple pick. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=The%20Lost%20Escape%2C%20Jibhi%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/758357609524923692</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Om Homestay Cottage</name><address>Om Homestay, Jibhi, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Jibhi outskirts | Homestay | under2500 | Price: 1890 | Rating: 5.0 (58, Airbnb) | 5.0-rated budget cottage near market cafes. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Om%20Homestay%2C%20Jibhi%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/jibhi-india/stays</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Serenity Wooden Cottage</name><address>Serenity Wooden Cottage, Jibhi, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Jibhi outskirts | Cottage | under2500 | Price: 2120 | Rating: 4.91 (100, Airbnb) | 100-review wooden cosy; outskirts quiet. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Serenity%20Wooden%20Cottage%2C%20Jibhi%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/jibhi-india/stays</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Hillhouse Sisters A-Frame</name><address>Hillhouse Sisters, Jibhi, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Jibhi farm | A-Frame | under2500 | Price: 2360 | Rating: 4.95 (20, Airbnb) | A-frame farm stay; glass windows, valley views, ideal for couples. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Hillhouse%20Sisters%2C%20Jibhi%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1583118387367694595</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Silence of Pines Seri</name><address>Silence of Pines, Seri, Jibhi</address><description>Seri / waterfall road | Homestay | under2500 | Price: 2020 | Rating: ~4.5 (Google) | Waterfall-road quiet; pine sit-outs. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Silence%20of%20Pines%2C%20Seri%2C%20Jibhi | Book: https://www.homestaysofindia.com/himachal-banjar-jibhi-silence-of-pines</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Moustache Shoja (Deluxe pvt room)</name><address>Moustache Shoja, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Shoja | Hostel-private | under2500 | Price: 2020 | Rating: ~8.5 (chain) | Book Deluxe w/ private balcony; social by day, private by night. Jalori sunrise easy. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Moustache%20Shoja%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.booking.com/hostels/city/in/jibhi.html</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Zostel Shoja (Private room)</name><address>Zostel Shoja, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Shoja | Hostel-private | under2500 | Price: 2130 | Rating: ~8.7 (chain) | Private-room base on Shoja ridge; same Jalori advantage as Moustache. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Zostel%20Shoja%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.booking.com/hostels/city/in/jibhi.html</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Tirthan Crest Banjar</name><address>Tirthan Crest, Banjar, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Banjar edge | Homestay | under2500 | Price: 1570 | Rating: ~8.6 | Cheapest verified base; Tirthan-side quiet. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Tirthan%20Crest%2C%20Banjar%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.homestays.co.in/gushaini-india</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Riverside Serenity Gushaini</name><address>Riverside Serenity, Gushaini, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Gushaini | Riverside | under2500 | Price: 2120 | Rating: 4.89 (47, Airbnb) | Tirthan-split base; river + Chhoie trek pairing. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Riverside%20Serenity%2C%20Gushaini%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1279706273527651930</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Cedar Nest Sainj</name><address>Cedar Nest, Sainj, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Sainj | Cottage | under2500 | Price: 1960 | Rating: 9.5 (44, Booking) | Extension-night anchor for Shangarh loop only. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Cedar%20Nest%2C%20Sainj%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.booking.com/cottages/city/in/sainj.html</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Mountain Nest Hirab</name><address>Mountain Nest Stay, Hirab, Jibhi</address><description>Hirab | Hotel | stretch | Price: 2690 | Rating: ~4.7 (direct) | Ridge views; direct-booking hotel. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mountain%20Nest%20Stay%2C%20Hirab%2C%20Jibhi | Book: https://mountainneststay.com/</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Tirthan Riverview Ropajani</name><address>Tirthan Riverview Homestay, Ropajani, Banjar</address><description>Ropajani | Homestay | under2500 | Price: 1680 | Rating: ~8.8 (direct) | River-view budget; Tirthan belt. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Tirthan%20Riverview%20Homestay%2C%20Ropajani%2C%20Banjar | Book: https://tirthanriverviewhomestay.bookmystay.io/</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Jaabal Riverside</name><address>Jaabal Homestay, Tirthan Valley, Banjar</address><description>Jawal / Badiropa | Homestay | under2500 | Price: 2020 | Rating: ~8.7 (direct) | Riverside rooms on the Jawal stretch. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Jaabal%20Homestay%2C%20Tirthan%20Valley%2C%20Banjar | Book: https://tirthanjaabalhomestay.com/</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Mizuki Retreat + Cafe</name><address>Mizuki Retreat, Gushaini, Tirthan Valley</address><description>Pekhri / Gushaini | Retreat | under2500 | Price: 2240 | Rating: ~4.7 (direct) | Stay + cafe in one; Gushaini riverside. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mizuki%20Retreat%2C%20Gushaini%2C%20Tirthan%20Valley | Book: https://mizukiretreat.com/</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Forest Lens Treehouse</name><address>Forest Lens Treehouse, Jibhi, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Jibhi forest | Treehouse | stretch | Price: 2570 | Rating: Superhost 6yr | 6-yr Superhost forest treehouse. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Forest%20Lens%20Treehouse%2C%20Jibhi%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.com.au/rooms/1438153001249315575</description></Placemark><Placemark><name>Rocky&apos;s Retreat A-Frame</name><address>Rocky&apos;s Retreat, Jibhi, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Jibhi 6km out | A-Frame | under2500 | Price: 2480 | Rating: Superhost | Superhost A-frame; outskirts quiet + view. | Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Rocky&apos;s%20Retreat%2C%20Jibhi%2C%20Himachal%20Pradesh | Book: https://www.airbnb.com.au/rooms/1146687534659285703</description></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>hotels</name><Placemark><name>The Woodpecker Inn &amp; Cafe</name><address>The Woodpecker Inn, Jibhi, Himachal Pradesh</address><description>Near Jibhi Waterfall | Hotel | under2500 | Price: Budget â€” verify live price for Oct dates | Rating: 9.3 (83, Booking) | Top-